ectares [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viminacium]; The site holds the remains of temples [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viminacium]; The site holds the remains of palaces (the imperial palace is geophysically detected, not yet excavated as of 2018) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viminacium]; The site holds the remains of hippodromes (geophysically detected, not yet excavated as of 2018) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viminacium]; The site holds the remains of Roman baths [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viminacium]; More graves have been discovered at Viminacium than at any other Roman archaeological site [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viminacium]"}]'::jsonb),
