illage at the site in aboriginal times [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cave_of_the_Guanches]; The village consisted of natural caves [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cave_of_the_Guanches]; The village also consisted of huts [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cave_of_the_Guanches]; Ceramics found inside the Cave of the Guanches have been dated to the 6th century BCE [SUPPORTED, no proving quote: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cave_of_the_Guanches]"}]'::jsonb),
