y [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Choquequirao]; After the abandonment the site was reclaimed by the dense Andean forest [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Choquequirao]; Stone lined channels ran through the site [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Choquequirao]; The channels carried ceremonial water or chicha [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Choquequirao]; The channels led to shrines at the site [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Choquequirao]; The channels led to baths at the site [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Choquequirao]"}]'::jsonb),
